# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas system

Establish or evolve a coherent product-wide design system supporting incremental adoption.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-system [request]` or `/pure-saas system [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Inspect existing codebase styles and components to identify styling discrepancies.
2. Define or update semantic foundations in `DESIGN.md` (colors, typography, spacing, radii, a11y).
3. Validate specification: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs validate DESIGN.md`.
4. Export tokens to code: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs export-tokens DESIGN.md --format css --out styles/tokens.css`.
5. Establish core foundation components and guidelines enabling incremental adoption without whole-app rewrites.
